text/html,8ab8149e5df38bcaa03f6e5949a70b0a1de2010b748f0f922e93a1bf53092d50,retained prior type,0,"70 ILCS 2605/5.7 (70 ILCS 2605/5.7) (from Ch. 42, par. 324q) Sec. 5.7. The board of trustees of the district shall consider the budget estimates as submitted to it by the executive director and may add to, revise, alter, increase or decrease the items contained in the budget. However, in no event may the total aggregate proposed expenditures in the budget exceed the total estimated means of financing the budget. The board of trustees shall, before January first of the budget year, adopt the budget which is effective on January first of the budget year. The appropriation ordinance and tax levy ","{""bounded_link_count"": 0, ""bounded_visible_character_count"": 6345, ""html_title"": ""70 ILCS 2605/5.7""}",7968,https://www.ilga.gov/Documents/legislation/ilcs/documents/007026050K5.7.htm,EXTLOC-bcdb8a51c47ccda452b923f1,,police,html,200,payroll_roster,https://www.ilga.gov/Documents/legislation/ilcs/documents/007026050K5.7.htm,high,0,0,False,RESCAND-372380ab660a9fef467bd4da,,MECHEXP-ad6a126f7841eeb416c370ae|MECHEXP-c1b578a9a00107b7e76271a5|MECHEXP-da7b318c180e3e2891d23a4f|MECHEXP-e65da81f28f2a58f550a1230|MECHEXP-ec50a1dc51f54e37f5a88c93,ROOTCOMP-677e1a83240e83d9869f19c1,external_search_wave_002_exhaustive_residual,,www.ilga.gov,Casey,0,true,007026050K5.7.htm,2022,payroll_and_earnings,payroll_roster,manual_review_candidate,1,EXTSOURCE-eac4265fc30f7c0cc6ef0c22,2026-08-05T17:35:54.614407+00:00,0,implementation_confirmation,police,official_administrative_summary,EXTSRCREV-48c96f61f1f43eb7488bf630,source_review_lane_004,4465,bounded retained-storage quota or free-space reserve reached,manual_review_hold,IL
