text/html,,retained prior type,0,"Retroactive Payroll Processing Administration Help I Financial Help I Performance Budgeting Help Retroactive Payroll Processing Retroactive pay processing is a feature of Advantage HRM that automatically recalculates employee pay based on retroactive pay-related changes. Retroactive pay processing may occur for pay periods for which the employee has already been paid, or for which pending payments have already been written. Retroactive Pay is calculated as follows: Pay Amount Employee should have Received - Actual Pay Amount Employee Received = Retroactive Pay Adjustment An example of this is ","{""bounded_link_count"": 14, ""bounded_visible_character_count"": 17251, ""html_title"": ""Retroactive Payroll Processing""}",31198,https://myadvantagecloud.cgi.com/GACCG40/PRDHelpService/hrm/MainHelp/mergedProjects/Payroll_Processing/PYRL/Retroactive_Payroll_Processing.htm,EXTLOC-865c25ef7ff7d47e75404c80,,unclear,html,200,earnings_report,https://myadvantagecloud.cgi.com/GACCG40/PRDHelpService/hrm/MainHelp/mergedProjects/Payroll_Processing/PYRL/Retroactive_Payroll_Processing.htm,low,0,0,False,RESCAND-e375db460b92e1a6f95054e9,,MECHEXP-2f427a10e3ed9834812d82f5|MECHEXP-6f0f24ab7ccfb6a58ad96bcc|MECHEXP-9b575bfd2bfa86c547cb32b2|MECHEXP-a7ec486f449b0592bb954f88|MECHEXP-becc8d86b97719117b61d5f6|MECHEXP-d8fbd71e866eaf6c138cb1c8|MECHEXP-f26dbd3d556cddc05502331e|MECHEXP-ff4d73c8e10f685d1ff771f2,ROOTCOMP-0ebfa6a88ca8b19b0175ab6e|ROOTCOMP-6442cfb1fa2faae863d4b38c,external_search_wave_002_exhaustive_residual,,myadvantagecloud.cgi.com,Bellmead,0,false,Retroactive_Payroll_Processing.htm,2026,payroll_and_earnings,earnings_report,manual_review_candidate,1,,2026-08-05T17:42:34.887876+00:00,0,,unclear,reputable_secondary_context,EXTSRCREV-295c16fd58b521802dce04fa,source_review_lane_004,5870,secondary context deferred from administrative readiness,secondary_context_only_deferred,TX
