text/html,,retained prior type,0,"Huron, OH - General Fund Summary CITY OF ALAMEDA, CA General Fund Fund 110 and Fund 111 The General Fund (Fund 110) is the operating fund of the City. All revenues and expenditures not accounted for in other designated funds are recorded in the General Fund. Although various departmental divisions are operated with special revenue and enterprise funds, the majority of City operations are charged to the General Fund. The General Fund section also includes the auxiliary funds of Special Warrants (111). General Fund Revenue The General Fund is inclusive of the majority of the operational revenues","{""bounded_link_count"": 7, ""bounded_visible_character_count"": 4555, ""html_title"": ""Huron, OH - General Fund Summary""}",23743,https://stories.opengov.com/huronoh/published/SobUjK04zza,EXTLOC-109b892ca18e807cf7e51a86,,unclear,html,200,payroll_roster,https://stories.opengov.com/huronoh/published/SobUjK04zza,low,0,0,False,RESCAND-b9bc4bc3ee89495928e55200,,MECHEXP-0ef05758427391391baf2af4|MECHEXP-3931c95f81e775f660b13d9d|MECHEXP-588cfa7e050b7ac135408c59|MECHEXP-65b25c0a5a7c4130c417d69e|MECHEXP-6df92cb2bb776be0589c3497|MECHEXP-807ac29aeb82831a48187820|MECHEXP-80b773b26d92d9106e16060a|MECHEXP-88c32f0a3873e55c62f430c2|MECHEXP-a320d9398fda99e5da2169aa|MECHEXP-de922c4737e806fa3d749efe,ROOTCOMP-0b8a1837188c768862a29cfa|ROOTCOMP-bdf5b5921d87c8834f0d062f|ROOTCOMP-c108614a939426af0cac13a6,external_search_wave_002_exhaustive_residual,,stories.opengov.com,Berlin,0,false,SobUjK04zza,2023,payroll_and_earnings,payroll_roster,manual_review_candidate,1,,2026-08-05T17:46:17.101723+00:00,0,implementation_confirmation,unclear,reputable_secondary_context,EXTSRCREV-aabba1ee350c88b842c15a81,source_review_lane_004,7813,secondary context deferred from administrative readiness,secondary_context_only_deferred,OH
